  "highlights": [
    "Reviewed service and stack rebuilds. See which services will change, which shared dependencies will stay running, and what could block the rebuild. Follow progress and see where it stopped if a step fails. You can reopen the operation record after a disconnect or app restart. Supported MCP clients can review and follow the same operations.",
    "Search and filter saved stacks. Find stacks by name, service, or linked group. Filter by status or sort by name, recent use, or which stacks need attention.",
    "Faster stack controls. Linked modes appear together in the menu bar. Switching opens the desktop review when needed. Stack cards keep actions visible and group launch links by service."
